$ Basis set library file automatically generatered by basis_set.py
$ 
$ invocation: basis_set.py --file=../basis/reference_edited/6p_dz_archive --print_polarization --print_scfbas --uncontracted --equal_exponent_threshold=0.05 --polarization_type=correlating --output=dyall.6p.dz.bas
$ 
$ These are the sets of functions selected from the TCA archive (apart from SCF):
$  ['correlating']
$ 
$ dyall.6p.dz.bas
